# Clip2GIF — environment configuration lives with each application.
# There is NO root-level .env file. Do not create one.
#
#   Backend  → backend/.env          (local, git-ignored; copy from backend/.env.example)
#   Frontend → frontend/.env.development.local (local, git-ignored; copy from frontend/.env.example)
#
# Production values are configured in the Render Dashboard per service
# (see render.yaml + README "Environment Configuration: Local vs Production").
# Never commit real URLs, origins, or secrets here.
